                    /></head>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Memorandum of Imperial German legation, dated June 13, 1893.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Counter memorandum of the Department of State, dated June 19, 1893.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>From the Secretary of State to the minister of Germany, dated June 19,
                        1893.</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>From the Secretary of State to the British ambassador, June 19,
                        1893.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
